{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You heard that Congress passed a Social\nSecurity bill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4060,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That part is true. It cleared the Senate\non the 29th of September, and the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8900,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "House passed it before that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11180,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is the part nobody is leading with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13840,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not one dollar of your check changes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16780,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not the amount, not the day it lands, not\nwho qualifies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21040,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nothing about the money moves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23040,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What moves is three words. And before\nthose three words were written into a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27920,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bill, they were tested on people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30740,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Around three and a half thousand of them\nwere sat down and shown two versions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34740,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the same information."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36900,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One group read the words the government\nuses today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40180,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other group read the words that are\nabout to replace them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43540,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nobody in that room was told what was\nreally being measured."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47020,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It worked. The people who read the new\nwords said they would wait longer before"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51600,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "claiming, by about 10 weeks on average."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54640,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the people it moved the most were the\nones who understood money the least."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59480,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Read that last part again, because it is\nthe whole thing in one line."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63900,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The new words did not do much to people\nwho already knew how the system works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68200,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They worked on the people who did not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70500,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those are the people who most need the\nletter to be straight with them, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74200,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they are the ones the wording moves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76480,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is not a bill about your benefit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78940,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a bill about the three words that\nsit between you and the biggest money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83420,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "decision of your life, and somebody\nchecked first that the new words would"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87540,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "change your mind. I cannot see your birth\nyear, your work record or your health,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92320,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and those three decide what you should\nactually do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95740,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I can do is give you all five\nchanges, tell you which one is honest, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100160,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "show you the one that has a mistake buried\ninside it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103500,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104860,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "62 is now the minimum."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107680,
    "dDurationMs": 6340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "30% less, forever. Today the government\ncalls 62 the early eligibility"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114020,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115440,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Early tells you something. It warns you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118240,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The new name is minimum monthly benefit\nage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121500,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Minimum sounds like a floor. A floor is a\nsafe place to stand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126580,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People hear minimum and they think of the\nsmallest thing they are entitled"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130740,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to, the thing that is theirs no matter\nwhat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134460,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is not a floor. It is the earliest\ndoor, and it is the most expensive one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139860,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the building."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141400,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is the number nobody puts next to\nthat word."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144800,
    "dDurationMs": 6180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If your full age is 67 and you start at\n62, every monthly payment is about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150980,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a third smaller. Not for a year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153460,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not until you reach 67. For the rest of\nyour life, and then for your widow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157980,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or your widower after you. That is not a\nfine you pay once and finish."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162460,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the price of every single month that\ncomes after."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166380,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this already happens without the new\nword."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170000,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the most recent year counted, about one\nin four people who started their"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174340,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "retirement benefit started it at 62."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177800,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "More than half started before they reached\ntheir full age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181380,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number two. 65 is called standard, and\nyour full age may be 67."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187280,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the one with the mistake inside\nit, and I want you to hear it slowly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192940,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The bill removes the words full retirement\nage and normal retirement age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198200,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In their place it puts standard monthly\nbenefit age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201820,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the age the bill attaches that word to\nis 65."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207020,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now hold that against the law as it stands\ntoday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210320,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your full retirement age is not 65."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213260,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was 65, back when Social Security\nstarted in the 1930s."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219400,
    "dDurationMs": 6540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Congress raised it in 1983, one slice at a\ntime, and for anybody born in 1960"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225940,
    "dDurationMs": 6377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or later it finished at 67. So a man born\nin 1962 turns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232440,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "65 in 2027. Under the new wording he\nreaches the standard age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239160,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Under the actual rules he is two years\nshort of his full one, and if he claims"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243840,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there his check is permanently smaller."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246980,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Standard is the most dangerous word in\nthis bill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250680,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It sounds like the setting everything\narrives on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253840,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It sounds like the one you get if you do\nnothing and ask nobody."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258240,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nothing arrives on a standard setting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260660,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You still have to apply, and the age that\nmatters for your money is the one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265340,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tied to the year you were born, not the\none tied to the new word."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269360,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And look at who this lands on hardest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273580,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "65 is already the age burned into\neverybody over 70,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278720,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because for forty odd years that was the\nreal number."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282800,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is also the age Medicare starts, so it\nis the one age people are certain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287540,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about. Put the word standard on it and you\nhave taken the age people already"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292640,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "half believe in and handed it an official\nsounding title."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296520,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman born in 1962 will turn 65 and see\nstandard on her letter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303060,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She signed up for Medicare that same year,\nso the number already feels correct."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308800,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If she claims there, she takes a permanent\ncut she never agreed to, and nothing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314000,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in that letter will have told her so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316020,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to be careful here, because this is\nthe one place I could mislead you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321420,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The bill does not change her full age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323680,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Her full age is still 67."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327360,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What the bill changes is which number\ncarries the word that sounds final."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332440,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number three. 70 is now the maximum."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335820,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The biggest check there is. I will be fair\nabout this one, because one change"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340780,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this bill helps you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342820,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today the government calls the extra money\nyou get for waiting the delayed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346780,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "retirement credit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348560,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Say that out loud to somebody at a kitchen\ntable and watch their eyes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352240,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It sounds like paperwork. It sounds like\nsomething that happens to other people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357800,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The bill deletes that phrase and names 70\nthe maximum monthly benefit age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363480,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the first time the government will\nhave put the word maximum anywhere"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368460,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "near the number 70. Waiting until 70 pays\nthe largest monthly amount the system"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373880,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will ever pay you, and after 70 it stops\ngrowing, so there is no reason to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379400,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wait past it. For years that has been the\nbest kept open secret in the whole"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385440,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "system, written down in public and\nunderstood by almost nobody."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391100,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The new word says it in one breath."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393920,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395240,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of the three is honest. Number four."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399160,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every letter they send you changes by\nJanuary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402880,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The bill gives the agency a deadline."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405280,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every piece of material has to use the new\nwords no later than 12 months after"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411020,
    "dDurationMs": 6280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the bill becomes law, or the first of\nJanuary 2027, whichever comes later."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417620,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That means the statement you get once a\nyear, the letters, the pages on the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422520,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "website, the booklet in your drawer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424760,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of it changes language. So the paper\nthat lands in your mailbox next year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430080,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will not read the way the one in your\ndrawer reads now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433640,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Same system, same rules, same money,\ndifferent words."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439480,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And nobody is going to post you a note\nexplaining why."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442840,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you keep your old letters, keep them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445380,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the new ones arrive you will want\nsomething to hold them against."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449460,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number five. A second law was signed, and\nthat one does something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454280,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the part almost nobody has\nmentioned,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457540,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it is the only thing in either"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459080,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bill that changes what actually happens to\na person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461720,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A separate bill went through on the same\nrun and it was signed on the seventh"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467500,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of October."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468840,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It deals with identity theft. If somebody\nsteals your Social Security number"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473640,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and uses it, you know what happens now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476580,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You telephone, you explain the whole\nthing, you are passed along, and the next"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481300,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "time you call you start the story again\nfrom the beginning with somebody who"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485860,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has never heard it. Under the new law the\nagency has to give you one named"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490760,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "person who handles your case from one end\nto the other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494920,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have 180 days to set it up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497580,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is a smaller headline and a bigger\nchange than anything in the wording"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501700,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bill. So that is the five. Now the part I\nowe you, because it is the thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506660,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everybody in the comments is saying and it\ndeserves a straight answer rather"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510860,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than a nod. The suspicion is simple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513640,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They tested the words, the words made\npeople wait, waiting means the government"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518360,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pays out later, and some people will not\nbe here to collect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522160,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the whole thing is a trick to keep your\nmoney."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525080,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is the honest version. The study\nmeasured what people said they would"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528740,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do, not what they actually did."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531140,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A person in a survey saying they would\nwait 10 weeks longer is not a person"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535480,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who waited. Nobody has the real numbers\nyet and will not have them for years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540520,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the rest of the suspicion is not\nwrong, and I am not going to pretend it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544360,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is. They did run a test. They did find\nwords that moved people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 548820,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They did then put those words into law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551300,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whatever the intention, that sequence is\nexactly what happened, and you are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555400,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "allowed to feel how you feel about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557880,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is what I would hold on to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559580,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A word is not a rule. The claiming ages\nhave not moved."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563980,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "62 still pays less, your own full age\nstill pays full, 70 still pays the most,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569860,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and all three of those were true last\nmonth and will be true next year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574480,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only thing that changed is which of\nthem sounds safe when you read it quickly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579440,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this week, do one thing. Find out your\nown full retirement age, the real"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584380,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one, tied to the year you were born."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586840,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not 65 because a new word says standard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589780,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not 62 because a new word says minimum."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592900,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yours. It takes one telephone call or one\npage on the government website, it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597880,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "costs nothing, and once you know that\nnumber no wording on any letter can move"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602200,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you. This is education. It is not advice\nabout your own situation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607020,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your birth year, your health and your work\nrecord are three things I cannot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611060,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "see, and those three decide your answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613960,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if your son or your daughter is\nsomewhere near 60, tell them this one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617940,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are the ones who will read the new\nletters first, and minimum is going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 621400,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be the first word they see."
    } ]
  } ]
}
